  "sources": [
    "Hits, frames, keys and events: rmxlinux Json/SkillData chr_0016_laevat_* and Json/BuffData buff_chr_0016_laevat_* (game 1.6), as compiled by efsim kit-draft; frames are SkillData timeline frames (JumpToAction not followed: the interim rule until in-game test 17). Batch-1 report docs/kit-batches/batch-1/chr_0016_laevat.md, pass-3 kit plan.",
    "Which values multiply (ratio, extra_scaling): Zero Sanity's in-game verified hit table (fixtures/zero-sanity-laevatain-p5.json). The data disagrees on three hits (the normal extra hit is atk_scale_3 × ratio; the enhanced battle skill's hits 1–2 have no ratio): in-game test 20.",
    "Stagger (poise): the damage units with damageAttributeType 1 in SkillData / BuffData (keys poise, poise_extra), hand-written (the compiler skips them).",
    "Melting Flame, Heat absorption and Scorching Heart: BuffData buff_chr_0016_laevat_energy (stacking type 3, lifeType 1, max_stack 4), _passive_teammate (abilityEvent 302, CheckDamageDecorateMask 2097156, MF < max_stack, passive_teammate_cd 1 s, one MF per Heat layer absorbed), _energy_icon_5 → _ignore_fire_resist (attr 98, ignore_fire_resist_duration); values from the talent-0 buff buff_chr_0016_laevat_passive.",
    "Twilight and its pauses: ultimate_skill CreateBuff show_weapon (16 s) at frame 0, which creates ult_end (15 s, the skill's `duration`); both run PauseBuffTime while buff_chr_0016_laevat_pause_ult (normal_skill_during_ult CreateBuff 0–115, autoFinishByAction) exists; combo_skill re-creates both every 0.1 s for frames 0–57 (stacking type 5); show_weapon's end runs SetSkillCdAtOnce (ultimate, 10 s, functionType 1)."
  ],
